{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/9933593c40245402e1b48ec3b1c3fb58.avif?t=1772730246\" alt=\"Game Title Banner\" width=780 height=155 /></span>Fusing the methodical decision-making of turn-based strategy with the tactical urgency of an RTS, Mordfield Command puts every turn at the center of humanity\u2019s survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity stands overrun and overruled by an algorithm that has seized control of Earth. From a fragile stronghold, contested resources must be reclaimed and territory secured against an enemy that begins with every advantage. Each decision  shapes the momentum of a conflict that will not yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on smart expansion, efficient build orders, and well-timed offensives. The objective is clear: reclaim control or be erased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.poster.avif?t=1772730246\" aria-label=\"Building expansion gif\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/fec76b1b45e620b1cf0dca42ecb98e6b.webm?t=1772730246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless attacks accompany every advance, and the enemy grows stronger with each passing day. Expansion is more than growth; reclaiming resources weakens the enemy while strengthening your position. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move too slowly and enemy reinforcements will outpace your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.poster.avif?t=1772730246\" aria-label=\"Defending attacks gif\" width=780 height=437 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/badb50b59b8b509732c8b67fc6dbbe37.webm?t=1772730246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce, and every piece of scrap is contested. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated structures generate additional action points at a power cost, giving you room to reinforce a position or press an attack when it matters. As the war escalates, new technologies unlock stronger defenses and countermeasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target enemy outposts to disrupt reinforcements before you're overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.poster.avif?t=1772730246\" width=780 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/3ae1052f91741cda9985bd993c3bea9d.webm?t=1772730246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war does not slow down, and neither can you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/extras/a84e179d2f989eb3db96c79dec0c0ef9.avif?t=1772730246\" alt=\"Game Features Banner\" width=780 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timed Rounds</strong> \u2014 Keep the pressure on by enabling an optional 15 or 30 second turn timer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Point Economy</strong> \u2014 Allocate action points at the expense of resources  to maximize your tactical options each turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Technology Tree \u2014</strong>\u00a0Unlock new unit abilities, tactical tools, and economic upgrades as you progress through multiple tiers of research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Map Editor</strong> \u2014 Create your own battlefields and unique missions with an in-game map editor. Share your creations with the community and test different strategies on other player made creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP/Multiplayer</strong> \u2014 Challenge friends in tactical 1v1 combat. Play  custom maps, change turn length, and assert your dominance in head-to-head gameplay.\u00a0 Play using in-game procedural generated battlefields or custom player-made\u00a0 ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Map Generation</strong> \u2014 Each play unfolds on a unique battlefield, keeping games fresh and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Terrain</strong> \u2014 Battlefields respond to combat and become damaged over time. Damaged areas become harder to traverse and modify offensive and defense bonuses, forcing players to adapt there strategy at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Meaty units grow stronger over time, earning experience on the battlefield. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully allows players to create groups of elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> \u2014 An expanding technology tree, diverse units, varied terrain, and multiple resources\u2014powered by procedural map generation\u2014ensure no two runs play the same.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blood Traitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/e3c6e20b3b2c7b48cd8bba01b72deca33474c3e3.jpg"},{"name":"Billy Badass","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/2097a48e4366a2d0de840886603425a4295214ff.jpg"},{"name":"Mr. Moneybags","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/ab494f3b9e47d115f62e7a7bb4ac8d6e828e045f.jpg"},{"name":"Action Economy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/6d25052e0a018ce9f3302dba77bbc74c1e62f43e.jpg"},{"name":"Meaty Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/8067e8716ec04fbec8aa5bc988ed4d42405d7708.jpg"},{"name":"Machine Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/12d0177dfeac76aa44c921166084809d10a0a7aa.jpg"},{"name":"Have A Nap... Then Fire Ze Missiles!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/121205efffbc8efc9684d73f609095862d281439.jpg"},{"name":"All The Science!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/4447373ac491af5bb2e1fcaf524260760a80ca32.jpg"},{"name":"Underpowered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/6a5fa28643770829a9bafbcbe303e0e7783bdad7.jpg"},{"name":"Shatter Their Sky!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2948470/163fc8baeb9892ff0a3229832937cdda669f2275.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1772730246","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2948470?t=1772730246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/e3e17a7f014fb117f7c79ce3ecb6163b63c54e4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772730246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/e3e17a7f01