" ><strong>Combat Unit Experience</strong> \u2014 Meaty units grow stronger over time, earning experience on the battlefield. Deploying and maneuvering squads carefully allows players to create groups of elite fighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong> \u2014 An expanding technology tree, diverse units, varied terrain, and multiple resources\u2014powered by procedural map generation\u2014ensure no two runs play the same.</p>","developers":["Software Verde, LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2948470/e99aefcd1e036e540526eaadf6ad5b6f6ebc83a7/header.jpg?t=1772730246","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 3rd gen (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura 13.5.2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Ventura 13.5.2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2948470/269105004/6492c13cb275df2ef7acd559c3892d8a3dca0348/1761226878/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767649075","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2948470/269105004/6492c13cb275df2ef7acd559c3892d8a3dca0348/1761226878/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767649075","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2948470/269105004/6492c13